        "     <p>The proposed sequence would begin by examining the relationships students already understand and the representations they use to explain photosynthesis. An idealized thylakoid diagram could help organize the causal pathway, but its simplified spatial arrangement would also give students something to examine as they developed their explanations.</p>",
